@pinstripe2plaid Which is another reason I’m not overly concerned about AGI. Humans will routinely misunderstand it and ignore it.

Can AGI tell us how to make the Browns into Super Bowl champions? No.

Can AGI tell us if Putin will use nukes if we give long range ATACMS to Ukraine? No.

